This is a placeholder.

The real "yt-dlp" binary is not checked into this repository (see .gitignore)
and needs to be added before building - see the README's
"Building from Source" section for exact steps:

  1. Download yt-dlp_macos from https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/releases/latest
  2. Rename it to exactly "yt-dlp" (no extension)
  3. chmod +x yt-dlp
  4. Drag it into the "Youtube X" group in Xcode, replacing this file,
     with "Copy items if needed" checked and the Youtube X target selected.
